// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1455792587" "Science Stun"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3995142465" "Increases the duration of a disorient power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3228055164" "Alpha Wave Bombardment"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3319353595" "Enhances Disorient Duration"
// Power Help Text :
"P2672012927" "By bombarding your body with alpha waves, you can increase the duration of powers that disorient your enemies. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P100814266" "Technology Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2893487158" "Benedict Tech Holey Field Generator"
// Power Help Text :
"P2803721894" "These power cells can be implanted on the backs of your hands. They create a field of energy that increases the duration of powers that disorient enemies. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P980755145" "Magic Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3482382136" "Bewildering of Hermes"
// Power Help Text :
"P406585951" "The entity of Travel, Hermes, can appear before your foes for brief periods. This should enhance the duration of spells that cause disorientation. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2815097547" "Mutation Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3084387207" "Evolution: Increased Stun"
// Power Help Text :
"P4095167078" "This radical augmentation of the mutant gene can cause the color of your eyes to constantly shift. This effect is frequently used to increase the duration of powers that disorient the enemy. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2030753972" "Natural Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3744971721" "Military Daze Strike"
// Power Help Text :
"P2757192071" "Military operatives have learned to disorient the enemy in order to carry out their missions unharmed. You can adapt their techniques to increase the duration of powers that disorient your foes. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P335810510" "Mutation Magic Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P533386118" "Bracer"
// Power Help Text :
"P831034812" "These shining bracers often mesmerize a hero's opponents, thereby increasing the duration of powers that cause disorientation.  Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1178662568" "Technology Natural Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4154292332" "Flashbang Grenade"
// Power Help Text :
"P296357073" "While this grenade doesn't damage the target, its bright, noisy explosion is often enough to increase the duration of powers that cause disorientation. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1549485320" "Mutation Science Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4113385614" "DNA Resequencing Stun Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P3698057389" "By resequencing your DNA, you can gain the ability to emit pheromones at will, thus increasing the effectiveness of powers that disorient. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P365054904" "Science Technology Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2882814541" "Dynamic Inhibitor"
// Power Help Text :
"P2914255720" "Patent Pending. Heroes have recently begun using this device to increase the duration of powers that disorient. By gauging reactions, the device quickly learns the light sequences and sounds that most effectively disrupt the target's equilibrium. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2754296450" "Natural Magic Stun"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Stun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P264913963" "Crowley's Symbol"
// Power Help Text :
"P3683139899" "Crowley used this strange symbol in a spell to corrupt an enemy's vision. By using it, you can increase the duration of powers that disorient your foes. Increases disorient duration by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
