// Display Name :
"P855083221" "WetWare Eng Neuralyzer"
// Power Help Text :
"P1617379486" "This neuralyzer can paralyze the higher brain functions of a target, increasing the duration of powers that cause sleep. Increases sleep duration by {Boost.Attrib.Sleep.Scale}%."

