"P3832105656" "Mutation Sleep"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P703327746" "Evolution: Neural Paralysis"
// Power Help Text :
"P401126751" "A subtle alteration to the mutant gene can increase the effectiveness of powers that put enemies to sleep.Increases sleep duration by {Boost.Attrib.Sleep.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
