// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P582234771" "Back Alley Nerve Strike"
// Power Help Text :
"P1036648538" "Special operatives must learn how to strike blows that will render an enemy instantly unconscious. This knowledge can increase the effectiveness of powers that put foes to sleep. Increases sleep duration by {Boost.Attrib.Sleep.Scale}%."

