// Power Set : Technology Natural Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P808710230" "Technology Natural Sleep"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1077734558" "Neuralyzer Grenade"
// Power Help Text :
"P3355715673" "This grenade is filled with compressed nitrous oxide. Although it can't put enemies to sleep on its own, it can extend the duration of powers that cause sleep. Increases sleep duration by {Boost.Attrib.Sleep.Scale}%."

