// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3875489805" "Mutation Science Sleep"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4012642008" "Molecular Bonding Neuro-Paralysis Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P489217911" "Through molecular bonding, you can enhance your inherent power to put enemies to sleep. Increases sleep duration by {Boost.Attrib.Sleep.Scale}%."

