// Power Set : Science Technology Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P769090191" "Science Technology Sleep"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P753219228" "Hyperbaric Matrix"
// Power Help Text :
"P3474088766" "Pat. Num. 13,126,779,974. This molecular matrix, when released, bonds instantly to other molecules in the atmosphere. It produces a anesthetic gas that can increase the duration of powers that cause sleep. Increases sleep duration by {Boost.Attrib.Sleep.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3949613644" "Natural Magic Sleep"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Sleep 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1964086028" "Crowley's Jewel"
// Power Help Text :
"P1288018755" "Crowley stored his sweetest dreams inside this jewel. By unleashing these dreams on a target, you can increase the duration of powers that cause sleep. Increases sleep duration by {Boost.Attrib.Sleep.Scale}%."

