// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2553181751" "Science Immobilize"
// DisplayHelp :
"P70560154" "Increases the duration of a immobilization power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2044864771" "Auroral Particle Bombardment"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3369673482" "Enhances Immobilization Duration"
// Power Help Text :
"P1710514646" "This research into auroral particles shows that they can sometimes increase the duration of powers that immobilize the enemy. Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

