// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P844266114" "Technology Immobilize"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3984258745" "WetWare Eng Neuralparalyzer"
// Power Help Text :
"P1541484919" "A neuralparalyzer can shut off your target's synaptic charges, thus increasing the duration of powers that cause immobilization. Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2132763040" "Magic Immobilize"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3945082886" "Bands of Hermes"
// Power Help Text :
"P3704794990" "The entity of Travel, Hermes, can grant you a faint shadow of the powers of Medusa, the gorgon. You won't be able to freeze your enemies in stone, but you will increase the duration of your immobilization magics. Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P998801756" "Mutation Immobilize"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2795990574" "Catalyst: Increased Immobilization"
// Power Help Text :
"P3673360944" "With this catalyst, you can modify your mutant gene so that you can secrete a potent anesthetic at will. This ability should increase the duration of powers that immobilize you foes. Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
