"P2343023632" "Natural Immobilize"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1525649552" "Military Immobilization Technique"
// Power Help Text :
"P232082652" "This strike to the lower back can temporarily render the target incapable of moving. When used with powers that immobilize enemies, this attack is quite effective. Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
