// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1652554343" "Cuirass"
// Power Help Text :
"P1646520992" "This ancient breastplate captivates those who look upon it, increasing the effectiveness of powers that immobilize. Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1524432225" "Technology Natural Immobilize"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2475915543" "Entangle Grenade"
// Power Help Text :
"P4099214677" "When this grenade explodes, it coats the nearest target in a sticky purple goo. It can be quite effective in increasing the duration of powers that immobilize.  Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
