"P2706336815" "Kinetic Inhibitor"
// Power Help Text :
"P2088903713" "Pat. Num. 12,402,476,491. By applying Modrin's Law, this device saps the kinetic energy of a target. It can increase the duration of powers that immobilize. Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

