// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Immobilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2689405727" "Li Tieh Kuai's Lens"
// Power Help Text :
"P827307166" "Li Tieh Kuai used lenses to focus his magical energy; after a time, the lenses took on powers of their own. This one has the ability to increase the duration of powers that immobilize foes. Increases immobilization duration by {Boost.Attrib.immobilize.Scale}%."

