"P1251062381" "This repulsor field generator can increase the knockback effect of a power. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2025073507" "Magic Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P190906528" "Smite of Hermes"
// Power Help Text :
"P4259866986" "The entity of Travel, Hermes, can alter the speed at which a target is knocked back, thereby increasing the distance they travel. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3950617615" "Mutation Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1173354391" "Awakening: Extended Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P560317362" "By stimulating the mutant gene, you can increase the knockback distance of one of your powers. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P349489781" "Natural Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P960630702" "Back Alley Bull Rush"
// Power Help Text :
"P2969142103" "On the street, the ability to surprise the opponent can make an assault twice as effective. By using this technique, you can increase the knockback distance of certain attacks. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
