"P3338177499" "Mutation Magic Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1998143075" "Vambrace"
// Power Help Text :
"P1173994014" "This piece of armor, worn on the forearm, can amplify a power to increase the distance the target is knocked back. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3573172945" "Technology Natural Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P45561408" "Repulsion Projector"
// Power Help Text :
"P3193249247" "By firing this repulsion gadget in conjunction with an attack, you can increase the distance a target is knocked back. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P189039225" "Mutation Science Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1466108357" "DNA Resequencing Knockback Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P126235428" "By resequencing your DNA, you can increase the knockback effect of one of your powers. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P673548909" "Science Technology Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2642896310" "Kinetic Accelerator"
// Power Help Text :
"P1818086427" "Pat. Num. 18,005,551,212. This device uses kinetic energy to increase the distance an enemy is knocked back by one of your powers. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1272617317" "Natural Magic Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3070006305" "Li Tieh Kuai's Bottle"
// Power Help Text :
"P2067993866" "Li Tieh Kuai used this bottle to store a powerful poison. By carrying it, you can increase the knockback distance of one of your powers. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1903713826" "Generic Knockback"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Generic Knockback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2175698" "Training: Knockback Distance"
// Power Help Text :
"P213266909" "Increases the KnockBack and KnockUp distance. Increases knockback distance by {Boost.Attrib.knockback.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4168126891" "Science Recharge"
// DisplayHelp :
"P671955669" "Increases the attack rate of a power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P750201266" "Alpha Particle Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P859406286" "Increases Attack Rate"
// Power Help Text :
"P1564111298" "A low-level radiation dose can decrease the recharge time of a single power, allowing it to be used more often in combat. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1692102635" "Technology Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P433264756" "WetWare Eng Adrenal Gland Booster"
// Power Help Text :
"P2401719153" "By artificially stimulating the adrenal gland, one power can be used more often in combat by reducing the recharge time. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P298549042" "Magic Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1346397399" "Renewing of Hermes"
// Power Help Text :
"P4088097489" "Hermes, the Entity of Travel, can use his gift of speed to allow you to use one of your magics more often, lowering its recharge time. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3585838783" "Mutation Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4058996878" "Evolution: Reduced Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P348683096" "This can alter the mutant gene in such a way that a single power's recharge rate is reduced.  Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2009039974" "Natural Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2215196454" "Military Speed"
// Power Help Text :
"P3217587560" "Airborne commandos use this technique to hasten their initial strikes. Natural Heroes can use this to increase the speed of an attack, by reducing its recharge time. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1450956608" "Mutation Magic Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1185579963" "Amulet"
// Power Help Text :
"P3605995361" "Magic amulets have the ability to reduce the recharge time of single spells. Some mutants also use amulet foci to achieve similar results. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3813903641" "Technology Natural Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2217109379" "Haste Device"
// Power Help Text :
"P1799959715" "This is an advanced gadget that actually creates a time-acceleration field to hasten the use of one power, lowering its recharge time. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1031071413" "Mutation Science Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3852988605" "Molecular Bonding Charge Rate Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P1851657119" "Through the proper application of molecular bonding, science can speed up the use of a single power, lowering its recharge time. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2233158978" "Science Technology Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3741892654" "Mercurial Theorem"
// Power Help Text :
"P4039649627" "Patent Pending. This newly discovered theorem can be applied to a single power. It will reduce the recharge time through a new application of quantum physics only recently discovered. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2086968415" "Natural Magic Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1886083724" "Crowley's Incense"
// Power Help Text :
"P3552497357" "By burning this incense, Crowley was able to increase the rate at which he was able to use some magics. Today, the same incense can be used to lower the recharge rate of a power of a Natural hero as well. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1811027262" "Generic Recharge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Generic Recharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3390545862" "Training: Recharge Reduction"
// Power Help Text :
"P3931540364" "Use this Training to focus your power and decrease the Recharge Time of a power. Increases recharge rate by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P211357291" "Science Heal"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2787720767" "Enhances the healing ability of a power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P751399406" "Polonium Irradiation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3128053613" "Enhances Heal and Absorb"
// Power Help Text :
"P65159455" "Analysis of polonium has proved that it can augment your ability to heal others and apply damage absorption powers. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1549722138" "Technology Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1793975595" "Portacio Ind Nanodoctors"
// Power Help Text :
"P1346730216" "These nanites can launch themselves from your body to that of your target, augmenting one of your healing or damage absorption powers.  Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1613335913" "Magic Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3509846644" "Grace of Joule"
// Power Help Text :
"P115160333" "The entity of Technology, Joule, can give you knowledge of the most potent medicines, increasing the effectiveness of your healing and damage absorption powers. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4254487915" "Mutation Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2799570073" "Catalyst: Amplified Healing"
// Power Help Text :
"P1493789598" "This catalyst modifies the portion of the mutant gene that governs healing powers. It should increase your ability to heal your allies and apply damage absorption powers. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P592869140" "Natural Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2759861002" "Military Healing"
// Power Help Text :
"P2941146912" "When caught in the field without proper medical supplies, soldiers often have to improvise. By learning to do the same, you can increase the effectiveness of your healing and damage absorption powers. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1314431086" "Mutation Magic Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2153059830" "Headband"
// Power Help Text :
"P745467001" "This simple platinum headband can increase the healing and damage absorption properties of a power. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P471619848" "Technology Natural Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2996427789" "Medical Device"
// Power Help Text :
"P3549639212" "This medical kit has everything needed to do serious battlefield medicine. In conjunction with healing and damage absorption powers, it can make the hero a real asset to his team. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P101182120" "Mutation Science Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P936618768" "Genome Alteration Healing Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P2847194514" "Just by swapping out a few nonessential nucleotide sequences, you can greatly enhance your inherent healing and damage absorption powers. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1335813144" "Science Technology Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P535503500" "Bioregenerator"
// Power Help Text :
"P1968270630" "Pat. Num. 10,451,397,452. The bioregenerator emits signals that stimulate the target's immune system. Used in conjunction with healing and damage absorption powers, it can do wonders for injured heroes. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4269249826" "Natural Magic Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3776114030" "Li Tieh Kuai's Candle"
// Power Help Text :
"P1737020271" "Li Tieh Kuai used this ever-burning candle in his healing rituals. The flame has become infused with his powers; by carrying it, you can augment your own healing and damage absorption powers. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1356042725" "Generic Heal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Generic Heal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P641760875" "Training: Healing/Absorb"
// Power Help Text :
"P1383303839" "Enhances the Healing and damage absorption ability of a Power. Increases healing, hit point buffs and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2016206086" "Science Range"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1987240213" "Enhances the range of a power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P444231955" "Neodymium Irradiation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P590548758" "Enhances Range"
// Power Help Text :
"P3822482471" "This analysis shows that neodymium can be used to increase the range of a power. Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1602116416" "Technology Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P573120602" "Benedict Tech Telescoping Eye"
// Power Help Text :
"P44138743" "This cybernetic eye uses built in sniper scope to increase the range of an attack. Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2521697449" "Magic Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2348507569" "Extension of Joule"
// Power Help Text :
"P2447445374" "The entity of Technology, Joule, can greatly enhance your perceptions. This should increase the range of a power. Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2027803229" "Mutation Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3956931647" "Awakening: Extended Range"
// Power Help Text :
"P151702228" "Eyesight can be greatly enhanced by a slight modification to the mutant gene. This process usually results in an increased range for a single power. Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3099164370" "Natural Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1340820452" "Military Extension"
// Power Help Text :
"P364620029" "Army snipers must concentrate to maximize the range of their weapons. This same technique will make it possible for you to extend the range of one of your attacks. Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P134539303" "Mutation Magic Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2097605520" "Helmet"
// Power Help Text :
"P3507386527" "This helmet focuses the mental energy of the wearer, increasing the range of a single power. Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2894555315" "Technology Natural Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2721020448" "Reach Device"
// Power Help Text :
"P4266868649" "This gadget shows you a detailed overhead view of the battlefield. With such information, you can increase the range of one of your powers. Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2051789032" "Mutation Science Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2375981844" "Genome Alteration Range Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P233754416" "By crossing your DNA with that of a hawk, you can gain exceptionally keen eyesight. Many heroes go through this operation to increase the range of one of their powers.  Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2976119402" "Science Technology Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3616742778" "Magnetic Aspirator"
// Power Help Text :
"P1498107965" "Pat. Num. 4,089,178,322. This stylish monocle contains an electromagnetic sight that improves the range of one of your powers. Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2011089577" "Natural Magic Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1678002937" "Nectanebo's Stone"
// Power Help Text :
"P420839978" "Nectanebo used these stones as reagents in his alchemical experiments. They absorbed enough magic to increase the range of a power.  Increases range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1919957438" "Generic Range"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Generic Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3543297689" "Training: Range Increase"
// Power Help Text :
"P2305495578" "Enhances the Range of a Power by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P84286084" "Science Endurance Discount"
// DisplayHelp :
"P311662952" "Decreases the endurance cost of a power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3149273847" "Boron Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2333592019" "Reduces Endurance Cost"
// Power Help Text :
"P3173255774" "An experiment shows that boron gas can reduce the amount of endurance a power takes. Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P449307326" "Technology Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3479468946" "WetWare Eng Cyberheart"
// Power Help Text :
"P654662117" "This small, sophisticated machine can replace a portion of your heart, reducing the amount of endurance required for a single power. Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3622357739" "Magic Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2579232324" "Power of Grey"
// Power Help Text :
"P3017437709" "The entity of Exploration, Grey, can cause one of your powers to be less wearying, by lowering its endurance cost. Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3516708235" "Mutation Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P247745110" "Awakening: Reduced Endurance"
// Power Help Text :
"P1417024045" "When stimulated, a dormant portion of the mutant gene causes enhanced production of adrenalin. By undergoing this operation, you can decrease the endurance cost of a power. Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3016251179" "Natural Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1302388953" "Military Encouragement"
// Power Help Text :
"P4191683168" "Drill sergeants use emphatic language to get the most out of exhausted troops. By recalling their words, you can decrease the amount of endurance needed for a power. Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P762454762" "Mutation Magic Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3324672458" "Torque"
// Power Help Text :
"P1352419764" "Magicians have used magical torques for years. Mutants have a similar focusing device that decrease the endurance cost of their inborn powers. Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3620822372" "Technology Natural Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2733824908" "Oxygen Device"
// Power Help Text :
"P3065057339" "This device can provide you with a direct feed of pure oxygen, thereby reducing the endurance cost of a single power. Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2999761685" "Mutation Science Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P896254949" "Molecular Bonding Adrenal Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P4033602300" "After genetic resequencing, you can learn to activate your adrenal glands at will. This will decrease the amount of endurance a power uses. Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1023181588" "Science Technology Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3929593133" "Metastable Capacitor"
// Power Help Text :
"P2830350058" "Pat. Num. 9,113,272,080. This capacitor stores a small amount of energy, thus reducing the endurance cost of one power.  Reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Endurance Discount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1766203392" "Natural Magic Endurance Discount"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
