"P687906494" "Stimulation of the mutant gene gives you access to your ancestral memories. By communicating these memories telepathically, you can arouse the instinctual fears of your enemies, increasing the duration of powers that cause fear. Increases fear duration by {Boost.Attrib.fear.Scale}%."

