"P2762656039" "This thin, gold chain has focusing properties that allow you to more effectively decrease the defenses of your enemies, at a greater cost to endurance.  Increases defense debuffs by {Boost.Attrib.Defense.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3759838656" "Technology Natural Defense DeBuff"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1545492836" "Adhesive Grenade"
// Power Help Text :
"P1410214548" "These grenades spray a fine mist of anesthetic gas on the target. Heroes often find them quite effective when used with powers that decrease a foe's defenses. Increases defense debuffs by {Boost.Attrib.Defense.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3671362996" "Mutation Science Defense DeBuff"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1342621284" "Genome Alteration Shield Drain"
// Power Help Text :
"P2972721764" "By tweaking your genome, you can enhance powers that reduce an enemy's defenses. Increases defense debuffs by {Boost.Attrib.Defense.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2109489775" "Science Technology Defense DeBuff"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P793201218" "Epidermal Degenerator"
// Power Help Text :
"P507015624" "Pat. Num. 14,159,896,712. The chemicals and nanites this device emits can slowly degrade the natural defenses of the target. It is a welcome addition to any power that lowers defenses. Increases defense debuffs by {Boost.Attrib.Defense.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4280876374" "Natural Magic Defense DeBuff"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P99217407" "Nectanebo's Gloves"
// Power Help Text :
"P3053124970" "Nectanebo himself wore these gloves while studying alchemy. The mystical properties of the herbs he used can augment your ability to decrease an enemy's defense. Increases defense debuffs by {Boost.Attrib.Defense.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P20248775" "Generic Defense DeBuff"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Generic Defense DeBuff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2589333002" "Training: Defense DeBuff"
// Power Help Text :
"P3822561246" "Enhances the effectiveness of Defense DeBuffs. Increases defense debuffs by {Boost.Attrib.Defense.Scale}%."

