// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1550712716" "Science Taunt"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1616754246" "Increases the duration a taunted target will stay on you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3981473078" "Positron Bombardment"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2837029972" "Enhances Taunt Effectiveness"
// Power Help Text :
"P3622554842" "Research into positrons has shown how to increase the duration of a taunt power. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2067757514" "Technology Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1396720663" "Benedict Tech Agonizer"
// Power Help Text :
"P1193159396" "The agonizer increases the duration of powers used to taunt the enemy by launching several hundred volts of electricity at the target. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2987339299" "Magic Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2701688565" "Voice of Hermes"
// Power Help Text :
"P3846056369" "The entity of Travel, Hermes, can grant you knowledge of insults from far-away lands, allowing you to taunt your foes for longer periods of time. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1553789143" "Mutation Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1016382167" "Evolution: Annoyance Factor"
// Power Help Text :
"P1105884778" "This alteration of the mutant gene can allow you to temporarily shut off all your inhibitions. Heroes have recently begun using this tactic to increase the effectiveness of their taunting powers. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2633522264" "Natural Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2645829631" "Military Insight"
// Power Help Text :
"P3485535552" "It is essential for any military commander to know the enemy as well as his own troops. By studying your enemies' fears and weaknesses, you can effectively taunt them for longer periods of time. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P742771373" "Mutation Magic Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P958358346" "Glasses"
// Power Help Text :
"P2719789432" "These glasses amplify the wearer's eyes, making it difficult for anyone to look away. Heroes often use such glasses to increase the duration of taunting powers. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2294696505" "Technology Natural Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2732642205" "Agony Grenade"
// Power Help Text :
"P3014695110" "This grenade emits a stinging gas that will burn the target's eyes, nose and throat. Such provocation is nearly always enough to increase the duration of a taunting power. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1577775714" "Mutation Science Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2527707771" "DNA Resequencing Taunt Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P1863588026" "By resequencing your DNA, you can learn to access genetic memories. By relying on this information, you should be able to successfully taunt foes for a longer length of time.  Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2502088928" "Science Technology Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P53700421" "Photonic Capacitor"
// Power Help Text :
"P524315131" "Pat. Num. 8,820,937,831. This invention stores photons and releases them in blinding pulses, thus angering the target and increasing your taunting capabilities. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1402988579" "Natural Magic Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P103190745" "Nectanebo's Ankh"
// Power Help Text :
"P3297344290" "Nectanebo used this ankh to call up the spirits of the dead and force them to do his will. One of his favorite tactics was to call upon the ancestors of his foes. This inevitably enraged his enemies, allowing him to taunt them more successfully. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1446058804" "Generic Taunt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Generic Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1667153040" "Training: Taunt Duration"
// Power Help Text :
"P3846600828" "Increases the duration a Taunted target will stay on you. Increases taunt duration by {Boost.Attrib.Taunt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P566642121" "Science Snare"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2167713378" "Increases the effectiveness of powers that slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P254387068" "Hydrogen Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P202772915" "Enhances Slow Powers"
// Power Help Text :
"P1941178956" "Experiments dealing with hydrogen lead you to believe that the gas can increase the effect of powers that slow. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P110412687" "Technology Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2370542002" "Portacio Ind Nanodegenerators"
// Power Help Text :
"P1004808269" "These hostile nanites settle around the joints of a target, making locomotion more difficult and increasing the effectiveness of powers that slow . Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3483669606" "Magic Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3350202633" "Pacification of Hermes"
// Power Help Text :
"P2523051719" "The entity of Travel, Hermes, can enhance the effectiveness of powers that slow your foes. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P557271698" "Mutation Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4030959504" "Evolution: Movement Degradation"
// Power Help Text :
"P1123129856" "A small alteration to the mutant gene can improve the effectiveness of powers that slow. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3780371997" "Natural Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3997580332" "Back Alley Crippling Blow"
// Power Help Text :
"P817536051" "By striking a blow in the correct spot, back alley fighters can render their opponents dizzy. This technique can be used to increase the effectiveness of powers that slow. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1374580968" "Mutation Magic Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3877995918" "Breastplate"
// Power Help Text :
"P2100933825" "This breastplate focuses and amplifies powers that slow. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4117622908" "Technology Natural Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1307053659" "Nullifier Device"
// Power Help Text :
"P4037045756" "This grenade assaults the target with a steady barrage of small electrical shocks, disrupting normal motor functions and increasing the effectiveness of powers that slow. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P597772327" "Mutation Science Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3731735390" "Molecular Bonding Deadliness Drain"
// Power Help Text :
"P2938049155" "Through molecular bonding, you can amplify your inherent ability to slow your foes.  Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3901317797" "Science Technology Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1053472925" "Muscular Atrophier"
// Power Help Text :
"P2305787599" "Pat. Num. 14,137,038,662. This invention uses ground-breaking technology to prematurely age its target, though the effect is temporary. The muscular atrophy caused by the effect can increase the effectiveness of powers that slow. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P775180902" "Natural Magic Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2666734578" "Crowley's Bracelet"
// Power Help Text :
"P2629102700" "Crowley used this bracelet to capture the energy of his enemies. By wearing it, you can increase the effectiveness of powers that slow. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P731554161" "Generic Snare"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Generic Snare 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3373643194" "Training: Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P1382976327" "Increases the effectiveness of Powers that slow. Increases slow durations by {Boost.Attrib.run.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3128655298" "Science Hold"
// DisplayHelp :
"P314033097" "Increases the duration of a hold power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1253829152" "Thallium Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1997397356" "Enhances Hold Duration"
// Power Help Text :
"P1513759805" "This experiment with thallium shows it can sometimes increase the duration of powers that hold the enemy in place. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3938226611" "Technology Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3688143508" "Benedict Tech Stasis Regenerator"
// Power Help Text :
"P600443931" "This cybernetic enhancement feeds extra energy to the part of your brain that governs your holding powers. This allows you to increase the duration of one such power. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3603693248" "Magic Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1409819991" "Paralyzation of Joule"
// Power Help Text :
"P2482590103" "The entity of Technology, Joule, can increase the potential of your holding magic. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1265903298" "Mutation Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2950549446" "Catalyst: Stasis Amplification"
// Power Help Text :
"P3482081891" "This catalyst alters the portion of the mutant gene that affects holding powers. By using it, you can hold enemies in place for longer periods. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2511602877" "Natural Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3362535458" "Back Alley Paralyzer"
// Power Help Text :
"P1644171897" "This swift chop to the back of the neck briefly paralyzes the recipient. This technique can increase the duration of powers that hold the enemy in place. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4172993479" "Mutation Magic Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1513618501" "Glove"
// Power Help Text :
"P1247060297" "These gloves allow you to focus powers that hold the enemy in place, thereby increasing their duration. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2868783777" "Technology Natural Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3324584623" "Net Projector"
// Power Help Text :
"P2405497251" "This projector fires a net of fine nylon at the target. It can increase the duration of powers that hold enemies in place. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2967836929" "Mutation Science Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3279068019" "DNA Resequencing Hold Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P1200169115" "By chopping out a small section of your DNA and replacing it with that of a cobra, you can learn to mesmerize your foes, thereby increasing the effectiveness of your holding powers. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P4185692081" "Science Technology Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3418794257" "Bonding Compound"
// Power Help Text :
"P2455614965" "Pat. Num. 11,156,934,212. Critics of this substance call it nothing more than an 'over-hyped crazy glue.' But heroes who have used it in combat can testify to its ability to increase the duration of powers that hold enemies in place. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1217783435" "Natural Magic Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3061660321" "Li Tieh Kuai's Net"
// Power Help Text :
"P755744740" "This magical net binds the target in a web of mystical energy. It can increase the duration of powers that hold the enemy in place.  Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3862028876" "Generic Hold"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Generic Hold 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1334137412" "Training: Hold Duration"
// Power Help Text :
"P2077605479" "Increases the duration of a Hold Power. Increases hold durations by {Boost.Attrib.hold.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2106183601" "Science Intangible"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2710549524" "Increases the duration of an intangibility power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3131815821" "Hydrazine Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2871999060" "Enhances Intangibility Duration"
// Power Help Text :
"P328180446" "Experimenting with hydrazine can sometimes increase the duration of intangibility powers. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3623207684" "Technology Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1528521983" "Portacio Ind Destablizer"
// Power Help Text :
"P2263180385" "This molecular destabilizer is highly dangerous, but it allows you to remain intangible for longer periods of time. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2595805222" "Magic Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1103839711" "Phasing of Grey"
// Power Help Text :
"P3977144466" "The entity of Exploration, Grey, can alter the nature of the matter in your body, increasing the duration of spells that make you intangible.  Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3727636698" "Mutation Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2533209749" "Awakening: Phase Extension"
// Power Help Text :
"P2869970870" "Doctors have finally located the portion of the mutant gene that governs intangibility powers. By stimulating this area, they can increase the duration of such powers. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1845497238" "Natural Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P547261340" "Dragon Elusiveness"
// Power Help Text :
"P3688469417" "The dragon evades like a ghost. By mastering this technique, you can increase the duration of your intangibility powers. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1606201144" "Mutation Magic Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P318688962" "Periapt"
// Power Help Text :
"P1967534938" "This small charm lets you remain intangible for longer periods of time. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3212526823" "Technology Natural Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2990931480" "Phase Device"
// Power Help Text :
"P1319224791" "This device can extend the time you can remain intangible, by applying the Speckston Principle of matter incohesion. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1739182581" "Mutation Science Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P246413599" "Genome Alteration Phase Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P570513281" "By altering your genome just a tad, you can increase the time that you can remain intangible.  Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2102420608" "Science Technology Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3951177644" "Oscillator Overthruster"
// Power Help Text :
"P289334528" "Pat. Num. 981,480,176. According to the theory that most solid matter is in fact composed of empty space, a person could pass through a wall if his atoms were lined up correctly. This invention does just that, lining up the atoms that compose your body in order to increase the duration of your intangibility power. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1944589217" "Natural Magic Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2853487434" "Crowley's Gate"
// Power Help Text :
"P3702420691" "Crowley used this model of a gate to set up a mystical barrier between his body and the world around him. You can use it to increase the duration of powers that make you intangible. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Generic Intangible 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2607441237" "Generic Intangible"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
