// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3063093897" "Training: Intangibility"
// Power Help Text :
"P2820316308" "Increases the duration of an Intangibility Power. Increases intangibility durations by {Boost.Attrib.Intangible.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2799263077" "Science Interrupt"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1143936689" "Decreases the interrupt time of powers that can be interrupted."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2793117964" "Thermodynamic Bombardment"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P587284817" "Decreases Interrupt Time"
// Power Help Text :
"P1407579831" "Thermodynamic particle bombardment can often reduce the interrupt time of a specific power. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3499734795" "Technology Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4183350746" "WetWare Eng Accelerator"
// Power Help Text :
"P3747790084" "This full nerve accelerator can be used to speed up your reactions, lowering the time needed to activate a power. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Magic Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P803458411" "Magic Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2356676665" "Skip of Joule"
// Power Help Text :
"P2827082377" "The entity of Technology, Joule, can slightly alter the flow of time, thereby reducing the activation time of many powers. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3157148167" "Mutation Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3003970603" "Catalyst: Chronometric Manipulation"
// Power Help Text :
"P3343716146" "This catalyst affects the mutant gene powerfully, giving you the ability to slightly manipulate time. Heroes frequently use this ability to decrease the time needed to activate a power. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1132670077" "Natural Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2557004641" "Back Alley Abbreviation"
// Power Help Text :
"P2310419812" "Back alley fighters must learn to move swiftly if they want to stay alive. By mastering their techniques, you can reduce the time it takes to activate a power. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Magic Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2444193235" "Mutation Magic Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P804149832" "Ring"
// Power Help Text :
"P617147197" "This ring can store the power of a mutant or magic user, thereby decreasing the length of time needed to activate a power. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Technology Natural Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2209197273" "Technology Natural Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2239222197" "Chronoenhancer Device"
// Power Help Text :
"P2718236632" "This device allows you to alter the flow of time, though only by nanoseconds.  Still, this is enough to decrease the activation time of a single power. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1544774769" "Mutation Science Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3981842927" "Molecular Bonding Time Manipulation Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P4220257601" "Through genetic resequencing, you can teach your body to regard one of your powers as a reflex, thus lowering its activation time.  Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Science Technology Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2138205285" "Science Technology Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1670426858" "Chronotranstabilizer"
// Power Help Text :
"P944111000" "Pat. Num. 8,931,029,448. This invention is the first step in time travel technology. It lets you reduce the time it takes to activate a power by repeatedly jumping you backward in time. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P479035245" "Natural Magic Interrupt"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Interrupt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3266587786" "Li Tieh Kuai's Sheath"
// Power Help Text :
"P1077126731" "Li Tieh Kuai made many of these sheathes for the Imperial Guardsmen, who thereafter boasted that they could draw their weapons at the speed of lightning. By wearing it, you can decrease the time it takes you to perform an attack. Reduces interrupt times by {Boost.Attrib.Interrupt.Scale}%."

