"P3554173718" "Resolution of Grey"
// Power Help Text :
"P3638121552" "The entity of Exploration, Grey, can grant you the ability to modify your powers that manipulate endurance.Improves endurance modification by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

