"P3204395437" "Awakening: Endurance Modification"
// Power Help Text :
"P3630704783" "By slightly altering the mutant gene, you can unlock its potential to control the body's electrical impulses. This is a good way to manipulate powers that modify endurance.Improves endurance modification by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

