"P1894979568" "Dragon Vitality"
// Power Help Text :
"P909516263" "The dragon never rests. By mimicking the great beast, you can manipulate your ability to modify endurance powers.Improves endurance modification by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

