"P3982198196" "Genome Alteration: Endurance Modification"
// Power Help Text :
"P1200028617" "By altering your DNA, you can force your adrenal gland to release a steady trickle of adrenalin into your bloodstream. This increases the effectiveness of powers that modify endurance.Improves endurance modification by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%."

