// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2558540946" "Enhances Damage Resistance"
// Power Help Text :
"P3633820852" "This experiment has shown that it is capable of bolstering the effectiveness of a Damage Resistance power. Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

