// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Magic Res Damage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2336702857" "Shield of Hermes"
// Power Help Text :
"P3780727248" "Hermes grants you the ability to shield yourself further from various attacks, increasing the Hero's resistance to damage. Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

