"P1113409539" "Catalyst: Improved Resistance"
// Power Help Text :
"P2353045096" "This catalyst affects the Mutant gene by bolstering the effect of a Hero's Damage Resistance. Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

