"P2914590491" "Mutation Magic Res Damage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Magic Res Damage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3166182119" "Cord"
// Power Help Text :
"P2472690636" "This cord, wrapped around the waist, will increase the amount of Damage Resistance a Hero has. Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

