"P1300165828" "Technology Natural Res Damage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Technology Natural Res Damage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1615368840" "Aegis Device"
// Power Help Text :
"P621574422" "This small device protects the Hero in a miniature graviton force field, that amplifies a Hero's damage resistance power. Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Mutation Science Res Damage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
