"P2511102422" "Mutation Science Res Damage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mutation Science Res Damage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3519872540" "Molecular Bonding Resistance Boost"
// Power Help Text :
"P2026441383" "Through this bonding, a Hero's innate resistance to damage can be increased. Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

