// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2404766883" "Science Technology Res Damage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Science Technology Res Damage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2777201857" "Composite Epidermal Underlay"
// Power Help Text :
"P3297217123" "Pat. Pend. This composite of various types of highly resistant materials can be added to make a character tougher and more resistant to types of damage.  Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Natural Magic Res Damage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2179834754" "Natural Magic Res Damage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Natural Magic Res Damage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4139638856" "Nectanebo's Gourd"
// Power Help Text :
"P3572360880" "This container, fashioned out of a gourd, once held the ingredients of Nectanebo's powerful spells. Merely possessing it now, it can improve a Hero's resistance to damage. Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

