// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4073707303" "Training: Resist Damage"
// Power Help Text :
"P139072481" "Enhances the Damage Resistance of a power. Increases damage resistance by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Hamidon Damage Accuracy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3766019472" "Hamidon Damage Accuracy"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3494848008" "Hamidon (All Origins)"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3536988138" "Enhances the damage and accuracy of a power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hamidon Damage Accuracy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4201071604" "Nucleolus Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1842924063" "Enhances Damage and Accuracy"
// Power Help Text :
"P1585375390" "The Nucleolus of the Hamidon was a tremendous source of power. Exposure to the Nucleolus has enabled you to significantly augment the damage and accuracy of one of your attack powers.  Increases damage by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}% and accuracy by {Boost.Attrib.Accuracy.Scale}%."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Hamidon Damage Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1325623249" "Hamidon Damage Range"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1431497060" "Enhances the damage and range of a power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hamidon Damage Range 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3073610899" "Centriole Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P890617852" "Enhances Damage and Range"
// Power Help Text :
"P2266477728" "Exposure to the Hamidon Centriole has enabled you to significantly augment the damage and range of one of your attack powers.  Increases damage by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}% and range by {Boost.Attrib.Range.Scale}%"

// ******************************************************************************** 
