// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3176301784" "Peroxisome Exposure"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P298558172" "Enhances Damage and Mez"
// Power Help Text :
"P1144788622" "Exposure to the Hamidon Peroxisome can enabled you to significantly augment the damage of your attack powers and can increase the duration of Sleep, Disorient, Immobilization, Hold, Confuse, Fear, and Intangibility powers.  Increases damage by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}% and status effect durations by {Boost.Attrib.Stun.Scale}%"

