"P2825874132" "Exposure to the Hamidon Ribosome can enabled you to significantly augment the damage resistance of a power and decrease its endurance cost.  Increases damage by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}% and reduces endurance costs by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%"

