"P3318742861" "Exposure to the Hamidon Microfilament can increase the speed of a travel power and decrease its endurance cost.  Increases movement speeds by {Boost.Attrib.Run.Scale}% and reduces endurance costs by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%"

