"P544777459" "Exposure to the Hamidon Golgi Apparatus can increase the Healing ability and Damage Absorption of a power and decrease its endurance cost.  Increases healing and damage absorption by {Boost.Attrib.Heal.Scale}% and reduces endurance costs by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}%"

