"P360927527" "Enhances Damage, Recharge and has a chance to deal minor Psionic damage"
// Power Help Text :
"P10075551" "The Will of the Seers enhancement gives the user a link into the Seer network thus increasing a power's damage by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}% and recharge by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%.  Additionally, the power that the Will of the Seers enhancement is slotted into will have a minor chance to inflict minor Psionic damage, however this effect will cease to trigger once the player reaches level 21.  This effect will trigger roughly 2 times per minute."
