// DisplayName :
"P848560903" "Attuned Dominion of Arachnos E"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2251541150" "UNIQUE -- No more than 1 enhancement of this type may be slotted by a character.  Enhances the accuracy of a power by {Boost.Attrib.Accuracy.Scale}%, damage by {Boost.Attrib.Damage.Scale}%, reduces endurance cost by {Boost.Attrib.Endurance.Scale}% and reduces recharge time by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%.  This enhancement can only be slotted by Soldiers of Arachnos and may be slotted into any Arachnos Soldier or Arachnos Widow damage power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Attuned Dominion of Arachnos E 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2628583493" "Dominion of Arachnos: Accuracy/Damage/Endurance/Recharge"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Attuned Dominion of Arachnos F 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2879214269" "Attuned Dominion of Arachnos F"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1762132941" "UNIQUE -- No more than 1 enhancement of this type may be slotted by a character.  Gives the slotted power a chance to Terrorize the target and reduce their damage for 10 seconds and reduces recharge time by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%.  This effect will trigger roughly 4 times per minute.  This enhancement can only be slotted by Soldiers of Arachnos and may be slotted into any Arachnos Soldier or Arachnos Widow damage power."

