"P150762216" "UNIQUE -- No more than 1 enhancement of this type may be slotted by a character.  Gives the slotted power a chance to reduce the target's movement speed and recharge rate for a short time, and reduces the power's recharge time by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%.  This enhancement's chance to trigger is equal to approximately 4 times per minute."

